Comment: 0,0:00:18.46,0:00:19.19,Usaghi Main,,0000,0000,0000,,Hm?{Yes?}
Comment: 0,0:05:21.68,0:05:23.68,Usaghi Main,Episode title,0000,0000,0000,,Dear Santa  #line 1 of credits screen
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.63,0:00:18.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.82,0:00:23.38,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What kind of present do you want Santa to bring you?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.13,0:00:29.33,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I haven't decided yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.36,0:00:37.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You need to decide soon, or it'll be too late.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.06,0:00:38.81,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,He has to come from far away, after all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.73,0:00:42.15,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Is that so...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.05,0:00:47.39,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,So, what is it that you want the most?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.35,0:00:50.69,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,A lop ear.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.69,0:00:52.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Don't you already have one?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.72,0:00:54.65,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It needs more friends. {Scarlet: You could possibly use he or she, but I don't want to be sexist, so I'll go with it. xP}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.15,0:01:08.90,Usaghi Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.33,0:01:12.20,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sorry for being late.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.20,0:01:14.02,Usaghi Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,No problem.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.54,0:01:15.67,Usaghi Main,Teacher,0000,0000,0000,,Rin-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.21,0:01:21.41,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,What's that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.90,0:01:24.46,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,A Christmas tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.30,0:01:29.82,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,And this?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:31.13,0:01:33.06,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Just something work-related.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.09,0:01:43.23,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Can we set the tree up?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.23,0:01:43.94,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Sure.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.81,0:02:02.85,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Daikichi, hurry up!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:03.19,0:02:04.44,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Okay.{I'll be right there.}
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.09,0:02:10.94,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,This one goes on the top, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.94,0:02:12.03,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,That's right.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.98,0:02:25.53,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.54,0:02:30.00,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Our place doesn't have a chimney.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.86,0:02:35.97,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Santa will find a way in. Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.03,0:02:40.99,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,I'll keep the door open, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.41,0:02:42.63,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,You don't need to.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.17,0:02:57.05,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,What's with the carrot?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:57.51,0:02:59.05,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,It's for the reindeer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.50,0:03:14.14,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.59,0:03:16.03,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Just a little longer.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.65,0:03:19.65,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Santa only comes to places where the kids are asleep.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.35,0:03:22.16,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Turn off the lights! Quick!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.22,0:03:26.34,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Yeah, yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:39.49,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (note line 1),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz3.64\pos(396,157)\frx10\fry6}Dear Santa
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:39.49,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (note line 2 & 3),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz4.591\pos(427,167)\frx10\fry10}Thank you for the present
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.56,0:04:39.49,Copy of Insert,SIGNS (note line 4),0000,0000,0000,,{\frz4.694\pos(506,272)}Rin
Dialogue: 0,0:04:53.80,0:04:56.83,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,I remember wanting to meet Santa, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:01.63,0:05:03.42,Usaghi Main,Dai,0000,0000,0000,,Rin, let's eat.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.42,0:05:04.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Okay!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.57,0:05:21.68,Usaghi Main,Rin,0000,0000,0000,,Thank you, Mr. Reindeer.
